# Test My Mettle (otherAreas 25): getSelectedOption's bets and getRewardMultiplier's rows, each edge bracketed. Each
# round: Devean's 120, a finish with the option, then a GM makes the quest available again (the vars kept: each round
# writes Timer and Reward anew, seen on the trace). The bet is the first of 1000, 500, 250, 100 the option exceeds, the
# hours the rest; the multiplier: hours > 72: 1; <= 24: 3.0; <= 36: 2.5; <= 48: 2.0; <= 60: 1.5; <= 72: 1.2. Option 100
# exceeds no bet: the Lua errors there on `player:getGil() >= nil` (a `lua:` line, which the recorder refuses), so it is
# left out; XI.Verify.Quests `oa g3 tmm` proves the C# does nothing. 20000 gil: every bet affordable (the gil edge is
# `#edges`).
lists Selbina/Devean/onTrigger Selbina/onEventFinish/120
char zone=Selbina pos=41.4,-14.6,40 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=1 gil=20000
rank 2
fame Sandoria 75
login
trigger Devean
finish option=1001                      # bet 1000, 1 h: Timer now + 144; Reward 3000 (x 3.0); begun
quest OtherAreas.TestMyMettle available # a GM
trigger Devean
finish option=1024                      # bet 1000, 24 h: Timer now + 3456; Reward 3000 (x 3.0); begun
quest OtherAreas.TestMyMettle available # a GM
